OL,3,GNEWSADelays on M1 after multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash causes fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree lanes have been closed on the M1
OL,7,Fin Northamptonshire due to a fire
OL,8,Fcaused by a multi-vehicle collision.
OL,10,FThe closures are in place on the
OL,11,Fnorthbound carriageway between junction
OL,12,F16 for Northampton and junction 18 for
OL,13,FRugby, Warwickshire.
OL,15,FNational Highways said there were
OL,16,Fdelays of more than half an hour.
OL,18,FPosting on X, it said firefighters were
OL,19,Fresponding at the scene.
